/*
  KeyboardShortcutsModal.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 modal/dialog · 0006 · KeyboardShortcutsModal (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native
  KeyboardShortcutsModal resolves (table "KeyboardShortcutsModal") lives here with
  its web `t(key, default)` English value. These entries fold into the app
  `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog at integration time; they are kept in a
  per-surface table so each parallel surface prompt owns its own strings without
  editing the shared catalog.

  The first group is the exact keys extracted from the web source
  (web/src/components/feedback/KeyboardShortcutsModal.tsx). The remainder backs the
  native state envelope (loading, error retry, freshness chip, connectivity banner)
  and the VoiceOver builders. Group labels, descriptions, and key tokens are NOT
  here — the web reads them already-translated from the shortcut registry, so they
  arrive as data on each `KBShortcutEntry`.
*/

